cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Release snapshot: cite the repository and the exact commit or release; this is not an external audit."
title: "btc-lean: a machine-checked Lean 4 model of Bitcoin consensus rules"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 executable model of Bitcoin consensus validation with a row-by-row
  Bitcoin Core traceability census: 726 consensus rows (676 proven, 50
  obsolete; 26 explicit model residuals), plus a separate 140-row wallet
  specification/obligation layer with 40 tagged rows and a 99-row obligation
  register. Includes static gates and a checksum-pinned data release.
  Candidate snapshot; not bitcoind, not externally audited, and not a claim of
  cryptographic port fidelity.
type: software
authors:
